      "normative_level": "SHOULD",
      "category": "BEHAVIORAL",
      "subject": "server",
      "stage": "nntp_fsm",
      "description": "400 SHOULD be used if the issue is only temporary (for example, because of load) and the client can expect to be able to connect successfully at some point in the future without making any changes.",
